+
+## Board Publication
+
+Boards can be published so that anyone with the secret public link can view them without signing in. Only board administrators can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board and creates its secret public link.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. The previous public link stops working immediately.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+### Public board URLs
+
+A published board is available at:
+
+- `GET /public/boards/:key`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/columns/:id`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/cards/:number`
+
+Only published cards are exposed through the public card URL.
